cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its evaluation protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "HarvestMetric: leakage-safe evaluation of crop-yield models"
abstract: >-
  A data-leakage case study on a synthetic crop-yield dataset, and a time-separated evaluation of a
  1 August forecast of Iowa county corn yield built on USDA NASS county yields and NASA POWER weather,
  with strong baselines, year-level uncertainty and a geographic check.
type: software
